RCCSD contraction inventory

The contraction expressions in inventory.py are adapted from PySCF 2.14.0:
pyscf/cc/rccsd.py (energy and singles part of update_amps) and
pyscf/cc/rintermediates.py (cc_Foo, cc_Fvv, cc_Fov).
