VibeQC modifications: expand intermediate definitions into named contractions,
retain full Fock diagonals, combine the two bare fov*T1*T1 contributions,
use exact coefficients, and lower to the existing TensorIR. No PySCF solver
code executes in the fixed-amplitude facade. The independent determinant
oracle is separately written from the second-quantized Hamiltonian.

Upstream cites Hirata et al., J. Chem. Phys. 120, 2581 (2004), Eqs. 35-39.
The actually audited source here is the pinned PySCF implementation, not an
assertion of a line-by-line audit of that article.
